---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CurrencyConverter from '../../components/tools/CurrencyConverter.jsx';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebApplication',
  name: 'PKR Currency Converter',
  applicationCategory: 'TravelApplication',
  operatingSystem: 'Any',
  url: new URL('/tools/pkr-currency-converter/', Astro.site).href,
  offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '0' },
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="USD to PKR & Travel Currency Converter"
  description="Convert US dollars to Pakistani rupees using the latest available reference rates. Check amounts like 10,000 USD or switch to GBP, EUR, AED and more."
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <nav class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Home</a> ›
      <a href="/tools/" class="hover:text-brand-600">Tools</a> ›
      <span>PKR Currency Converter</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">PKR Currency Converter</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8">
      Quick conversions between Pakistani Rupees and travel currencies you'll actually use.
    </p>

    <CurrencyConverter client:load />

    <section class="prose max-w-none mt-12">
      <h2>How to convert 10,000 USD to PKR</h2>
      <p>Enter 10,000, select USD as the source currency and PKR as the destination. The estimate uses the rate shown for the date of the latest update. For application costs, use the <a href="/tools/visa-fee-calculator/">visa fee calculator</a>.</p>

      <h2>Why your bank may quote a different amount</h2>
      <p>This converter uses reference rates from ExchangeRate-API. Your bank, card provider or exchange company may use a different rate and add charges. Check the displayed update date and ask for the total PKR cost before paying. <a href="https://www.exchangerate-api.com/">Rate provider</a>.</p>

      <h2>Check cash rules before flying</h2>
      <p>Before taking foreign currency out of Pakistan, check the State Bank's current passenger limits and Pakistan Customs' declaration requirements. The rules can depend on age, destination and the amount already taken abroad during the year. Also check the rules where you arrive or change flights.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.sbp.org.pk/laws-regulations/notifications-issued-by-the-state-bank-of-pakistan-under-foreign-exchange-regulation-act-1947-vii-of-1947">State Bank foreign-exchange notifications</a> · <a href="https://www.fbr.gov.pk/currency-declaration-system/163159">Pakistan Customs currency declarations</a>.</p>

      <h2>Questions to ask your bank</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Is international spending enabled for this card and destination?</li>
        <li>What are the daily spending and cash withdrawal limits?</li>
        <li>What exchange rate, bank charges and applicable taxes will be used?</li>
        <li>What happens if an ATM or shop offers to convert the payment to PKR?</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Compare the final cost of the available payment options. Check account eligibility and card availability directly with a provider before relying on it for travel.</p>

      <h2>Example travel budget</h2>
      <p>If your hotel quote is USD 200 and transport is USD 50, enter 250 and select USD to PKR. Budget separately for any bank charges, taxes and other travel costs. For visa application costs, use the <a href="/tools/visa-fee-calculator/">visa fee calculator</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Travel-money guidance reviewed 16 November 2026. Exchange rates have their own update date in the converter above.</p>
    </section>
  <section lang="ur-Latn" class="prose max-w-none mt-10" aria-label="Roman Urdu madad">
  <h2>10000 dollar kitne Pakistani rupay hain?</h2>
  <p>Upar Amount mein 10000 likhein, From mein USD aur To mein PKR chunain. Calculator dikhaye gaye exchange rate ke mutabiq rupay ka andaza batayega. Rate ki tareekh bhi check karein. Bank ya exchange company ka rate aur charges alag ho saktay hain.</p>
</section>
</article>
</BaseLayout>
